  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach Wild Stitch or Springstep
    bond level grants this ally 10% weapon damage and 5% reach. Caps: +50% damage,
    +20% reach; final reach cap still applies.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Bullet
    split: +1\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging
    three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA frost-country
    pilgrim carrying the last spoon from a communal pot. They rationed too strictly
    and remember the neighbour who went hungry. They seek seeds for cold soil rather
    than another rule for enduring hunger.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nOwn weapon damage
    gains 0.5% per companion body in the roster, before later balance modifiers.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: frost, hide. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
